  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 14.079999923706055px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 246);\">134 fotos del final de la segunda etapa</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 14.079999923706055px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 246);\">, de la Llosa a Onda,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 14.079999923706055px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 246);\">de la XXXII Volta Ciclista a Castell&oacute;, organizada este a&ntilde;o por el Club Ciclista Sepelaco y en la que ha tenido un especial protagonismo la Caja Rural. Ha ganado Francisco Garc&iacute;a, del Valencia Tierra y Mar.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/10390168_772165216150527_1525707212570190266_n.jpg\" alt=\"10390168_772165216150527_1525707212570190266_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/img_1362.jpg\" alt=\"img_1362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/img_1363.jpg\" alt=\"img_1363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/img_1364.jpg\" alt=\"img_1364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/img_1365.jpg\" alt=\"img_1365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/metaondavoltaciclistacastello14/img_1366.jpg\" alt=\"img_1366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img 